  "release_notes": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/jamixm4-crypto/natbypass/compare/v1.9.226-beta16...v1.9.226-beta18\n\n- Fix Peer Invisibility and Virtual IP Collision:\n  * Dynamic deterministic VIP assignment for default subnet CIDR (/24) and .0/.1 templates\n  * Preserve active peer registry entry without wiping VirtualIP to empty string\n- Fix Relay Fallback Blackhole:\n  * Trigger central encrypted relay fallback when direct P2P is unconfirmed or packet loss > 30%\n  * Prevent speculative UDP sendto from suppressing MQTT/WSS relay transmission\n- DirectP2P Freshness and Expiration:\n  * Demote stale DirectP2P status if no direct inbound UDP packets received for 15s\n  * Retain and sync LastDirectSeen timestamp across periodic signaling beacons\n- Network Route Cleanup:\n  * Remove redundant 100.64.200.0/24 route injection on custom profile subnets (fixes subnet conflict in L3 routing)",
